<title>NETHERLANDS: MULDER BOSKOOP POSTS SMALLER LOSS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>MULDER BOSKOOP POSTS SMALLER LOSS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				 0.48 vs   0.96</p>
<p>    Turnover				14.8  vs  14.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Mulder Boskoop NV, a producer of machinery for the</p>
<p>construction sector, said that in view of developments within</p>
<p>the company it could not give a forecast for 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
